{"r":8,"c":[[54,"9.1"],[79,"Application Information"]]}
{"r":9,"c":[[54,"The INA219 is a current shunt and power monitor with an I2C- and SMBus-compatible interface. The device"]]}
{"r":10,"c":[[54,"monitors both a shunt voltage drop and bus supply voltage. Programmable calibration value, combined with an"]]}
{"r":11,"c":[[54,"internal multiplier, enable readouts of current and power."]]}
