{"r":47,"c":[[54,"The INA219 measures the voltage across a current-sensing resistor (R"],[400,") when current passes through the"]]}
{"r":48,"c":[[376,"SHUNT"]]}
{"r":49,"c":[[54,"resistor. The device also measures the bus supply voltage, and calculates power when calibrated. This section"]]}
